(LIB-35 -- a list's element type in the .lib is compiler-inferred from
 the exported function's own body: uniform-typed elements get "list of
 number"; disagreement or no evidence gets plain "list".
 Ran, from the repo root:
   VOX_CORE_PATH=/home/josj/scr/english/vox/coreasm
   /home/josj/scr/english/vox/target/release/vox
   docs/ledger/probes/libraries/shared/LIB-listinfer.vox --shared -o listinfer.so
   cat listinfer.lib
 expected output: exit 0, and listinfer.lib reads:
   Library listkit version "1.0".
   Location "./listinfer.so".

   Table of Contents:
       To 'make numbers', returning a list of number.
       To 'make mixed', returning a list.
       To 'echo list' with a list called items, returning a list.
)

Library listkit version "1.0".

To 'make numbers'.
  a list called out is [].
  Append 1 to out.
  Append 2 to out.
  Return a list, out.

To 'make mixed'.
  a list called out is [].
  Append 1 to out.
  Append "two" to out.
  Return a list, out.

To 'echo list' with a list called items.
  Return a list, items.
